## SUBMISSION COMPLIANCE TRACKER

### **MANDATORY COMPLIANCE STATEMENT:**
Before submitting, complete this verification:

```
✅ GATE 1: Input validation and auto-population complete
✅ GATE 2: Research complete with 6-8 linkable sources identified
✅ GATE 3: Title generation and selection complete (8 titles, 6-criteria scoring)
✅ GATE 4: Content writing with progressive verification complete
✅ GATE 5: Hard verification passed - external links counted, additional instructions verified

EXTERNAL LINKS FINAL COUNT: ___/8 (MUST be 6-8)
INTERNAL LINKS FINAL COUNT: ___/8 (If URLs provided: 3-8 with editorial value)
ADDITIONAL INSTRUCTIONS FINAL STATUS: ___% implemented
SENSITIVE CONTENT DISCLAIMER: Added/Not Required
AUTO-POPULATED FIELDS USED: List any fields that were auto-generated
META DESCRIPTION LENGTH: ___/160 characters
PRIMARY KEYWORD IN FIRST 50 WORDS: Yes/No

COMPLIANCE CONFIRMED: All mandatory requirements met ✅
```

**🚨 SUBMISSION BLOCKED UNTIL:** All gates cleared and compliance confirmed

